# HelpMe Rules

- One responsive codebase; desktop >= 1024px, mobile below. Content left, Map + Voice right (desktop); map top, content in bottom sheet, floating mic (mobile).
- Source of truth for visuals: `/design-reference` screenshots. Never copy Stitch HTML directly.
- Icons: Lucide only, via one `Icon` wrapper. No emojis in the UI.
- Colors: red ONLY for SOS and urgent. Teal for primary. Use design tokens, never hardcoded colors.
- Not overloaded: only essential info. Spacious. Large touch targets (min 56px). Simple readable fonts.
- Language toggle on every screen. All strings via i18n.
- Animate transform and opacity only; respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- API keys never in the client. Mock data must be synthetic.
- TypeScript strict. Small components. No dead code.
